        "created_at": "2026-09-25T18:56:05Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-09-25T18:56:05Z",
        "body": "An update for anyone following this: zxing-cpp tracks this in zxing-cpp/zxing-cpp#1120 (QR codes with non-compliant finder patterns) and zxing-cpp/zxing-cpp#1149 (dotted finder patterns). Your image still fails with zxing-cpp 3.1.1, which flutter_zxing 3.1.0 ships: the symbol is found but fails error correction. The fix belongs in zxing-cpp's detector, so I'm closing this in favour of those issues. flutter_zxing will pick up detector improvements when it moves to a newer zxing-cpp.",
